<h1>Teamo 运动图标 · 九组方案(A-I)</h1>
<p class="sub">四组<b>库选型</b>(A-D) + 五轮<b>风格扩展</b>(E 像素 / F 手绘 / G 配色 / H 手机端全套 / I 厚实 Duotone)。全部免费商用:Tabler=MIT · MingCute=Apache2.0 · Lucide=ISC · Iconoir=MIT · Phosphor=MIT · PixelartIcons=MIT · Material Symbols=Apache2.0。<b>回复编号或「E+G-2」这类组合都行</b>。</p>
<nav class="top"><a href="#sA">A Tabler</a><a href="#sB">B MingCute</a><a href="#sC">C Lucide</a><a href="#sD">D 混合</a><a href="#sE">E 像素</a><a href="#sF">F 手绘</a><a href="#sG">G 配色</a><a href="#sH">H 手机端</a><a href="#sI">I Duotone</a></nav>
<div class="note">说明:①「开合跳」所有库均无正解,各方案用近似人形并标注;②像素风动作图标为自绘 12×12(正是补缺口的思路);③手绘风是真实 SVG 滤镜处理,不是贴图;④跳绳只有 Tabler 有正解,别的方案都是近似。</div>
<section class="scheme" id="sA"><header><b>方案 A · Tabler 纯系</b><small>MIT · 1.5px 锐利线稿 · 细节丰富</small></header>
    <div class="sports"><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></div><b>跳绳</b><small>唯一正解图标</small><em>协调 · 心肺</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-run"/></svg></div><b>开合跳</b><small>近似:跑步人形</small><em>全身 · 热身</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></div><b>深蹲</b><small>近似:杠铃负重</small><em>下肢力量</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stretching-2"/></svg></div><b>拉伸</b><small>正解</small><em>放松 · 柔韧</em></div></div>
    <div class="ctx"><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · 运动选择(选中态)</small>
      <div class="sim-tabs"><span class="on"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-run"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stretching-2"/></svg></span></div><div class="sim-choice"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></div></div><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · Workout 菜单四宫格</small>
      <div class="sim-menu"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-heartbeat"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-trophy"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-settings"/></svg></span></div><small class="dim">记录 · 力量 · 成就 · 设置</small></div></div></section><section class="scheme" id="sB"><header><b>方案 B · MingCute 圆润系</b><small>Apache 2.0 · 圆头填充线稿 · 儿童亲和感</small></header>
    <div class="sports"><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></div><b>跳绳</b><small>正解(跨库)</small><em>协调 · 心肺</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-run-line"/></svg></div><b>开合跳</b><small>近似:跑步人形</small><em>全身 · 热身</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></div><b>深蹲</b><small>正解:深蹲人形</small><em>下肢力量</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-yoga-line"/></svg></div><b>拉伸</b><small>近似:瑜伽伸展</small><em>放松 · 柔韧</em></div></div>
    <div class="ctx"><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · 运动选择(选中态)</small>
      <div class="sim-tabs"><span class="on"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-run-line"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-yoga-line"/></svg></span></div><div class="sim-choice"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></div></div><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · Workout 菜单四宫格</small>
      <div class="sim-menu"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-heartbeat-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-trophy-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-settings-6-line"/></svg></span></div><small class="dim">记录 · 力量 · 成就 · 设置</small></div></div></section><section class="scheme" id="sC"><header><b>方案 C · Lucide 极简几何</b><small>ISC · 极简抽象 · 语义最弱(对照组)</small></header>
    <div class="sports"><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-activity"/></svg></div><b>跳绳</b><small>抽象:节律波</small><em>协调 · 心肺</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-person-standing"/></svg></div><b>开合跳</b><small>抽象:人形</small><em>全身 · 热身</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-dumbbell"/></svg></div><b>深蹲</b><small>近似:哑铃</small><em>下肢力量</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-footprints"/></svg></div><b>拉伸</b><small>抽象:步迹</small><em>放松 · 柔韧</em></div></div>
    <div class="ctx"><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · 运动选择(选中态)</small>
      <div class="sim-tabs"><span class="on"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-activity"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-person-standing"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-dumbbell"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-footprints"/></svg></span></div><div class="sim-choice"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-activity"/></svg></div></div><div class="sim"><small>设备端 · Workout 菜单四宫格</small>
      <div class="sim-menu"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-activity"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-dumbbell"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-trophy"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#lucide-settings"/></svg></span></div><small class="dim">记录 · 力量 · 成就 · 设置</small></div></div></section><section class="scheme" id="sD"><header><b>方案 D · 混合精选(推荐)</b><small>跨库取语义最准 · 视觉重统一</small></header>
