    <div class="tchip" style="background:#171225;color:#ff6b9d"><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#iconoir-running"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stretching"/></svg></span></div><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-heartbeat"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-trophy"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-settings"/></svg></span></div></div></div><div class="theme"><div class="tname">海盐薄荷<small>#5ef2c8 on #0e1a18</small></div>
    <div class="tchip" style="background:#0e1a18;color:#5ef2c8"><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#iconoir-running"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stretching"/></svg></span></div><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-heartbeat"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-trophy"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-settings"/></svg></span></div></div></div><div class="theme"><div class="tname">阳光柠檬<small>#ffe14d on #151310</small></div>
    <div class="tchip" style="background:#151310;color:#ffe14d"><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#iconoir-running"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-line"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stretching"/></svg></span></div><div class="trow"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-heartbeat"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-trophy"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-settings"/></svg></span></div></div></div>
<small class="dim" style="color:#5f6b74;font-size:11px">每行上排=运动四件套,下排=Workout 菜单;所有配色保持 ≥4.5:1 对比度</small>
</section><section class="scheme" id="sH"><header><b>方案 H · 手机端 UI 图标全套</b><small>Tabler 统一 · 家长端 App 16 枚常用图标 + 真实界面模拟</small></header>
<div class="phone-grid"><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-user"/></svg><b>我的孩子</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-bell"/></svg><b>通知</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-send"/></svg><b>发送邀请</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-calendar"/></svg><b>运动计划</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-clock"/></svg><b>时长</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-stopwatch"/></svg><b>倒计时</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-heart"/></svg><b>鼓励</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-trophy"/></svg><b>成就</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-flame"/></svg><b>卡路里</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-moon"/></svg><b>休息</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-circle-check"/></svg><b>已完成</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-share"/></svg><b>分享成绩</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-home"/></svg><b>首页</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-plus"/></svg><b>添加</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-chevron-right"/></svg><b>进入</b></div><div class="ph-ic"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-settings"/></svg><b>设置</b></div></div>
<div class="ctx" style="grid-template-columns:1fr"><div class="sim-phone">
<div class="ph-top"><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-user"/></svg><b>小宇的运动</b><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-bell"/></svg></div>
<div class="ph-card"><svg class="ic3" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg><div><b>跳绳</b><small>协调 · 心肺</small></div><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-chevron-right"/></svg></div>
<div class="ph-card"><svg class="ic3" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-barbell"/></svg><div><b>深蹲</b><small>下肢力量</small></div><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-chevron-right"/></svg></div>
<div class="ph-cta"><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-send"/></svg> 邀请运动</div>
<div class="ph-check"><svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-circle-check"/></svg> 已连接设备 <svg class="ic2" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-clock"/></svg> 08:24</div>
</div></div>
</section><section class="scheme" id="sI"><header><b>方案 I · 厚实 Duotone / 填充风</b><small>Phosphor Duotone(MIT) + MingCute Fill(Apache 2.0) · 高辨识度 · 远距可读性最好</small></header>
<div class="sports"><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></div><b>跳绳</b><small>线稿正解(duotone 无跳绳,后续可手绘 duotone 化)</small><em>协调 · 心肺</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-walk-fill"/></svg></div><b>开合跳</b><small>近似:动作人形</small><em>全身 · 热身</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-fill"/></svg></div><b>深蹲</b><small>正解填充版</small><em>下肢力量</em></div><div class="sp"><div class="sp-ico"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-yoga-fill"/></svg></div><b>拉伸</b><small>近似:瑜伽伸展</small><em>放松 · 柔韧</em></div></div>
<div class="ctx">
<div class="sim"><small>设备端 · 运动选择(选中态)</small><div class="sim-tabs"><span class="on"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#tabler-jump-rope"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-walk-fill"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-fill"/></svg></span><span class=""><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-yoga-fill"/></svg></span></div><div class="sim-choice"><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#mingcute-squats-fill"/></svg></div></div>
<div class="sim"><small>设备端 · Workout 菜单四宫格</small><div class="sim-menu"><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#ph-heartbeat-duotone"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#ph-barbell-duotone"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#ph-trophy-duotone"/></svg></span><span><svg class="ic" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><use href="#ph-gear-duotone"/></svg></span></div><small class="dim">记录 · 力量 · 成就 · 设置</small></div>
</div></section>
</body></html>